              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "ToastyOven6142"
            },
            "reviewBody": "An Egg Cream NEVER, EVER uses Hershey Syrup. Ugh. You can buy a 22 oz bottle of Fox's Chocolate Syrup \"U-bet\" at Amazon for $8.98. They have the lowest price found. I am a native New Yorker and this has been a favorite for years.",
