            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "FlimsyCocoa8420"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I can’t have fat nor dairy nor too much sugar. So I used plain almond milk, a Tbl of plain cocoa powder, a small hit of probiotic sold at Costco in tiny bottles Optional if you need to take that), a tsp of peppermint extract, a little sweetened coffee creamer and seltzer from our soda stream machine. I blended in my vitamix with about four ice cubes. Delish!!! Vitamix makes a hefty foam on top, so you think you’re drinking something decadent.",
            "datePublished": "2022-07-19T22:36:13.884Z"
          },
